验。\n6.\t熟悉I-III期临床研究或参与过NDA核查经验；英语读写能力良好。\n7.\t灵活应变、出色的组织能力、注重细节以及积极主动的学习态度","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-14T15:42:01","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"93bb777b-71f2-4c60-99f6-9b9997de8c4e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561313433,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"项目管理高级经理(J15015)","OrgId":700293696,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、协助项目负责人制定创新药开发计划。 \n2、协调内外部资源，推进项目按计划开展，把控并监督各项进程，确保项目顺利推进并实现各阶段目标。\n3、协助项目负责人对外包机构如 CRO 或 CDMO 等的选择、协调和合作跟进等事宜。 \n4、起草、审核和管理与外部合作方和外包机构的项目合同，跟进合同履行情况和付款进度，确保合同按时完成。\n5、 参与制定IND申报计划，协调内部撰写和整合申报材料，配合完成IND申报工作。\n6、协助项目负责人进行创新药项目和运营预算的制定和跟踪。\n7、 负责实施财务流程的具体操作，定期与财务部门沟通公司财务状况和研发资金需求，同时确保公司的报税和对账如期完成。\n8、负责实施采购流程的具体操作，并与采购部门及时沟通处理采购相关事宜。","Require":"1、本科以上学历，生物、药学、医学、化学等相关专业，有免疫学背景者优先。\n2、 熟悉创新药研发的科学运营，包括项目管理、合同管理、预算管理、供应商管理等。\n3、 具有创新药临床前项目管理、IND申报经验（有临床I期项目管理经验者优先）。\n4、具有较强的责任心，工作勤奋、自我激励，可以独立高效地完成各项工作。\n5、 能同时处理多项任务，有